sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GS as Guardrails Server<br/>8033/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Chunker as Chunker Service<br/>8085/TCP gRPC TLS/mTLS
    participant InputDet as Input Detectors<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant LLM as TGIS / Caikit NLP<br/>8033 or 8085/TCP gRPC TLS/mTLS
    participant OutputDet as Output Detectors<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant OTLP as OTLP Collector<br/>4317/TCP

    Note over Client,OTLP: Flow 1: Unary Classification with Text Generation

    Client->>GS: POST /api/v1/task/classification-with-text-generation<br/>Header passthrough, TLS optional
    GS->>OTLP: Trace span (W3C traceparent)
    GS->>Chunker: ChunkerTokenizationTaskPredict (input text)<br/>mm-model-id header, TLS/mTLS
    Chunker-->>GS: Tokenized chunks
    GS->>InputDet: POST /api/v1/text/contents (per chunk)<br/>detector-id, x-model-name headers
    InputDet-->>GS: Detection results (HAP, toxicity, PII)
    GS->>LLM: Generate / TextGenerationTaskPredict<br/>Header passthrough, TLS/mTLS
    LLM-->>GS: Generated text
    GS->>Chunker: ChunkerTokenizationTaskPredict (output text)<br/>mm-model-id header
    Chunker-->>GS: Tokenized output chunks
    GS->>OutputDet: POST /api/v1/text/contents (per chunk)<br/>detector-id, x-model-name headers
    OutputDet-->>GS: Output detection results
    GS-->>Client: Classification + generated text response

    Note over Client,OTLP: Flow 2: Streaming Chat Completions with Detection

    Client->>GS: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>Header passthrough, TLS optional
    GS->>InputDet: POST /api/v1/text/chat (last message)<br/>detector-id header
    InputDet-->>GS: Input detection result

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over GS,OutputDet: Concurrent streaming pipeline
        GS->>LLM: POST /v1/chat/completions (stream=true)<br/>Bearer token, SSE
        LLM-->>GS: SSE token stream
        GS->>Chunker: BidiStreamingChunkerTokenizationTaskPredict<br/>mm-model-id, concurrent chunking
        Chunker-->>GS: Chunk boundaries (streaming)
        GS->>OutputDet: POST /api/v1/text/contents (per chunk)<br/>Concurrent detection (max 5)
        OutputDet-->>GS: Detection results (batched & reordered)
    end

    GS-->>Client: SSE stream with detection results

    Note over Client,OTLP: Flow 3: Streaming Content Detection (ND-JSON)

    Client->>GS: POST /api/v2/text/detection/stream-content<br/>ND-JSON stream, TLS optional
    GS->>Chunker: BidiStreamingChunkerTokenizationTaskPredict<br/>Bidi streaming, mm-model-id
    Chunker-->>GS: Chunk boundaries (streaming)
    GS->>OutputDet: POST /api/v1/text/contents (concurrent per-chunk)<br/>detector-id header
    OutputDet-->>GS: Detection results
    GS-->>Client: ND-JSON response stream
